{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "bffea95a-de07-8ff2-9b47-7741375179d6",
  "created_at": "2026-01-14T09:58:00-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Manuel Furtado",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T09:53:51-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T09:53:56-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, thank you for taking my call. My name is Manuel Furtado. I am calling because I would like to put up a fence at my house, and I wanted to ask about it. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T09:54:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, happy to help, Mr. Furtado. Do you have an address for the property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T09:54:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, of course. It is 470 Gibbs Avenue, on the Ocean Drive side. Thank you for asking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T09:54:23-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. And tell me a little about the fence. What are you planning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T09:54:29-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, we have a dog, and he is very quick. He slips out of the yard whenever the gate is open, so I want a fence to keep him in. I am planning vinyl, five feet tall. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T09:54:44-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, vinyl, five feet. Is this going around the whole yard, or just a section?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T09:54:50-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Most of the back and along both sides, up to the front corners of the house. Not across the front. I hope that is acceptable, thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T09:55:01-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's helpful. So to your main question, yes, a fence generally does need a permit here, and height is part of that. At five feet you'll want to go through the permit process before anything goes in the ground."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T09:55:16-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. Thank you. Then may I ask, if I hire a contractor, does the contractor handle the permit, or is that the owner's job? Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T09:55:27-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Either can do it. A lot of contractors pull the permit for you as part of the job, but you should ask them up front, and the property owner is ultimately responsible that it's done. If they say they'll do it, get that in writing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T09:55:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Thank you very much. And one more question, please. Do I need a survey of the property? Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T09:55:52-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A survey isn't always required, but you do need to know where your lot lines are, because the fence has to sit on your side. If you have an existing plot plan or survey from when you bought the house, that's usually what people use. Do you have one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T09:56:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I believe there is something in the closing papers. I will look for it tonight. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T09:56:18-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. The application will typically ask for a sketch showing where the fence goes, the height, the material, and the distance from the property lines. Is your lot a corner lot, by any chance?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T09:56:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, it is not a corner. It is in the middle of the block. Thank you for asking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T09:56:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that keeps it simpler. Corner lots have extra visibility rules."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T09:56:43-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[crosstalk] Excuse me, sorry, I did not mean to interrupt. I was only going to say, I would rather do this correctly. My brother built the shelves behind me here in the room, and they still wobble, so I am careful about who builds what. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T09:57:01-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Doing it right the first time is the way to go. You can pick up the fence permit application at our office in City Hall, or I can have it sent to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T09:57:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If it is not too much trouble, I will come in to pick it up. What are your hours, please? Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T09:57:24-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "We're open weekdays during regular business hours. Bring your survey or plot plan if you find it, and your contractor's information if you've chosen one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T09:57:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Very good. I will do that. Would you like my phone number in case something is needed? It is 401-555-0181. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T09:57:43-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have that, 401-555-0181. I'll note it with your address. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T09:57:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is everything. Thank you very much for your help, Miss Chaudhry. Have a good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-14T09:57:57-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Mr. Furtado. Take care."
    }
  ],
